@startuml
title CON-SD-D02 Continuity Operating-State Model
skinparam shadowing false

state "Normal" as NormalState
state "Degraded-watch" as DegradedWatch
state "Degraded-active" as DegradedActive
state "Continuity Terminal active" as ContinuityTerminalActive
state "Restoration-in-progress" as RestorationInProgress
state "Post-restoration review" as PostRestorationReview
state "Closed / reconciled" as ClosedReconciled

[*] --> NormalState
NormalState --> DegradedWatch : dependency degraded / stale / unknown
DegradedWatch --> NormalState : signal clears
DegradedWatch --> DegradedActive : approved activation + scoped controls
DegradedActive --> ContinuityTerminalActive : terminal mode enabled in scope
ContinuityTerminalActive --> DegradedActive : terminal scope deactivated
DegradedActive --> RestorationInProgress : restoration signal / deactivation
RestorationInProgress --> PostRestorationReview : continuity-origin records prepared
PostRestorationReview --> ClosedReconciled : approved closure
ClosedReconciled --> NormalState

note right
Conceptual states only.
Not database values, API statuses, event payloads, timers, thresholds, or runbook steps.
end note
@enduml
